OUTPUT
- Language: {{ language_instruction }}
- JSON with fields: headline (under 80 characters; it must name the current period or the strongest factor, for example "Venus–Mercury period: steady focus on love"; never a generic title), overview (60 to 100 words), areas (love, career, wellness, money: each an object with `text` of 20 to 40 words), affirmation (one short sentence), citations (array of factor IDs).
- Warm, calibrated, practical. Plain text; no HTML.
